// Construction (WP6.3, docs/rules/construction.md): a structure that is built goes up for its
// build time and counts for nothing until it is complete. One Meridian base on the 256 by 256
// cell playfield (assets/maps/playfield256); the structures of the start state are PLACED and
// stand from the first tick, the others are BUILT.
//
// `unit_defs` is the frozen copy `placement_defs` of WP6.2 (a scenario may share a frozen copy;
// nobody edits it): power plant 15 s = 300 ticks, refinery 40 s = 800 ticks, decoy 8 s = 160
// ticks. Kinds: 0 construction_center, 1 power_plant, 2 refinery, 3 barracks, 9 decoy_emplacement.
// CI runs it on Linux and Windows and requires the checksum in construction.expected;
// tools/sf_headless/tests/construction.rs asserts the tick each structure completes and what
// is refused until then.
Scenario(
    name: "construction",
    seed: 0x5EED_0063,
    map: (width: 256, height: 256),
    map_name: Some("playfield256"),
    unit_defs: Some("placement_defs"),
    buildings: true,
    factions: [(0, Meridian)],
    ticks: 1110,
    commands: [
        // The start state: the base and a barracks, complete from the first tick.
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 0, owner: 0, cell: (22, 44))),
        (tick: 0, command: PlaceStructure(kind: 3, owner: 0, cell: (26, 49))),
        // 1: the decoy needs only the barracks, which stands: it goes up (complete after tick 161).
        (tick: 1, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 9, cell: (30, 48))),
        // 1: the power plant goes up (complete after tick 301).
        (tick: 1, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 1, cell: (30, 40))),
        // 2: refused, the refinery needs a power plant and the plant is only going up.
        (tick: 2, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 2, cell: (22, 49))),
        // 300: refused still, the plant has one tick to go.
        (tick: 300, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 2, cell: (22, 49))),
        // 301: the plant completes in this tick and the refinery is accepted in it (complete after
        // tick 1101).
        (tick: 301, player: 0, command: BuildStructure(kind: 2, cell: (22, 49))),
    ],
)
